Files in this folder are libffi (<https://github.com/libffi/libffi>), as
LiveCode's livecode-thirdparty carried it: git_master/ holds the newer
sources the arm64 Mac build uses, from commit ee718066
(git_master/source.txt); src/ and the include_* folders hold the older
sources, and each platform's generated headers, that the other builds
use.

One local change, marked "OXT-Beyond" in the source:

- In src/arm/sysv.S, the five loads and stores of several VFP registers
  (in ffi_call_VFP and ffi_closure_VFP) are written in the unified
  syntax: vldmiagt, vstmiaeq, vstmdb sp! and vldmia, where they were
  fldmiadgt, fstmiadeq, fstmfdd sp! and fldmiad. They are the same
  instructions with the same encodings; GNU as takes either spelling,
  and Clang's integrated assembler, the only assembler in an Android NDK
  from r24 on, takes only these. tools/ci/tests/test_android_engine.py
  assembles every libffi assembly file the Android build compiles.
